Banking: compute turn = normAngle between next seg direction and current seg direction. `group.rotation.z = clamp(-turn * .9, -.45,.45)` (sign maybe). Use THREE.MathUtils.lerp with dt.

We need normAngle imported? cityextra imports clamp, rand, pick, chance, TAU, makeRng; add lerp? Use THREE.MathUtils.

