But note when dwell is set to 6.5, we then decrement. At 0, set departCool=5. At 16 m/s it travels 80 in 5s, enough to clear. The next station is at least ~90 apart? Westbrook -260 to Nova Central 170 = 430; Eastgate 430 to wrap to -260 = 510. Fine.

Add `departCool:0` to rail object and modify. Let me re-edit that block.

